{"text": "It had been a hard year with little work, and Tom had trained poorly, with no partner to spar with and never enough to eat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Gayety Club secretary had already advanced him three pounds, the losers share of the purse, and he would not lend a single penny more. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom was forty now, and he knew better than anyone how much harder it was to get into condition at forty than in youth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he stood up to leave, Lizzie kissed him, which she seldom did, and said in a low voice, You must beat him, Tom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he won, he would receive thirty pounds, enough to pay all his debts, but if he lost, he would get nothing, not even tram fare home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was two miles to the Gayety, and as he walked, he remembered the days when he had ridden to his fights in cabs with rich friends. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In those days he had been the heavyweight champion of New South Wales, and the men he had beaten were older and already worn out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He remembered old Stowsher Bill, who had cried in the dressing room after losing to him, and only now did Tom begin to understand why.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "b", "e", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "h", "a", "r", "d", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "T", "o", "m", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "r", "a", "i", "n", "e", "d", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", "l", "y", ",", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "n", "o", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", "n", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "p", "a", "r", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "n", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "e", "n", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "a", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "G", "a